  "description": "Jang Hui-Mun, who runs a cafe with his mother in the quiet countryside village of Sanbom, is troubled by his mother's sudden employment of a shabby man. Hui-Mun, constantly entangled with this slightly flawed man, resolves to kick him out, but strangely, his lower half finds himself drawn back to him...! \n\nA slightly wild, slightly murderous romance begins!\n\n(Source: Boomtoon, translated)",
